# RUN(ALL): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# ALL-NOT: found under first
# ALL-NOT: went on
# ALL: crashed with
# RUN(NONE): run-in-shell mechanisms=none
# NONE-NOT: found under first
# NONE-NOT: went on
# NONE: crashed with

